  "evidence": "A: NHS funding rises above inflation; recruit 92,000 nurses and 28,000 doctors; Pharmacy First; 50 more Community Diagnostic Centres; dental recovery plan; women’s health strategy; Tobacco and Vapes Bill; 30 hours’ free childcare from 9 months; Family Hubs nationwide; expand SEND places; energy plan to treble offshore wind, deploy SMRs, and provide national energy-efficiency vouchers to keep bills down. B: Scrap Net Zero and renewable subsidies; fast‑track North Sea oil/gas and shale; ban transgender ideology in schools; replace Equalities Act; redefine hate crime; consider leaving ECHR; freeze non‑essential visas and expand detention/deportations; healthcare vouchers and 20% tax relief on private care; zero basic‑rate income tax for NHS/care staff for 3 years.",
